| **G3.1** | Open Room Door | **#** | Achieve | Room door is opened | **OR** | Door can be opened unassisted or with cooperation. |
| **G3.2** | Retrieve Dishes | **;** | Achieve | Dishes are retrieved | **AND** | Retrieval and tracking must be executed sequentially. |
| **G3.3** | Track Dish Retrieval | **-** | Achieve | Dish retrieval is tracked | **-** | Leaf task: robot logs dish retrieval details. |

